; ============================================================
; BOSS HP bar — top of screen, full width (Run 15).
; Hidden by default; HUD.gd toggles it on the FX bus signals
; (boss_registered / boss_unregistered) and refreshes the fill on
; boss_hp_changed. UISkin frames it and stamps the 刃 seal onto the
; name label. The breakbar (Run 117) is built under it in code.
; ============================================================
[node name="BossBarSection" type="Control" parent="."]
